{"s":[[null,1,[["g",[["Dark_Shrine_of_Night_Terrors.png",120,[]]]],["p",["The Dark Shrine of Night Terrors is an altar found in the ",["l","女巫小屋","Witch's Hut"],". It can be accessed after completing the ",["l","任务","Goblin Problem"]," quest. ",["l","玩家角色","The player"]," can offer a ",["l","奇怪的小面包","Strange Bun"]," to toggle ",["l","怪物","monsters"]," spawning on ",["l","农场","the farm"],". This is available for all ",["l","农场地图","farm maps"],", including ",["l","农场地图","Wilderness"],"."]]]]]}